  O7  COPY VS. SHARE when a closed reading is grafted. Copying keeps closed
      readings immutable; sharing makes later changes visible in every reading
      that grafted them. Copy is the safer default.

  O8  WHETHER A CLOSED READING CARRIES ITS ONTOLOGY SET (§8.3). Initialisation
