      from the root pointer by enrichment.

  O9  HOW THE ONTOLOGY SET IS UPDATED WHEN THE CONTRACTION OPERAND IS A CLOSED
      READING OR AN ABSTRACTION TITLE (§8.6). Both carry their own ontology sets,
